<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Citibank sets A$232 mln mortgage-backed bond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Citibank sets A$232 mln mortgage-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank Ltd said on Thursday it is issuing a A$232 million mortgage-backed securities issue to fund its varible rate home loan portfolio.</p>
</text>
